  "description": {
   "en": "Determined to turn his life around, Takuto enrolled in a magic school, only to be bullied. At the job agency, he was mocked, and at the guild, he was utterly defeated by a 12-year-old kid. Takuto (a former shut-in, now 30 years old), the weakest and most uncool guy in this town, one day gained the ability [Evil Eye - the power to seal a demon in his eye]. Manipulating earth, commanding lightning, making girls fall for him, even seeing through clothes..."
